%LCClerk
%LC店员
\dWelcome, Senpai!\d%K%P
「欢迎光临，前辈！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「………哈？」%K%P
%LCClerk
%LC店员
\dAh, I-I'm sorry! I made a mistake again! Welcome. Would\nyou like a table for one?\d%K%P
「啊，抱、抱歉，又搞错了！\n欢迎光临。一位客人么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, no, I'm meeting someone... Oh, there she is. Thank\nyou very much.\d%K%P
「啊，不是的，有人在等…啊，在呢。\n非常感谢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSorry. Did I make you wait?\d%K%P
「抱歉，久等了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I just arrived myself. Oh, and I'm not saying this\nbecause of social etiquette or anything.\d%K%P
「没，我也刚来。\n不是客气也不是社交辞令而是事实」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You really haven't changed at all.\d%K%P
「…你果然还是没变啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't change that much in just two years. Why don't you\nsit down?\d%K%P
「仅仅２年也不会变吧。\n坐么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, right. I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊，抱歉」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I guess you're right. You can't change much in two\nyears. You don't need to apologize for things like that.\d%K%P
「…仅仅２年也不会变吧。\n也不用为那种事情道歉哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
She really didn't change at all...%K%P
真的没变呢…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo, what is it? I was really surprised when you suddenly\ncalled me.\d%K%P
「嗯，怎么了？\n突然往学校打电话，真让人吃惊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCould we please place our orders first? I had to walk\nthrough that searing heat outside to reach this place. I\nfeel like there's a desert in my throat. Um, yeah, I'd\nlike one iced cappu--\d%K%P
「那之前先让我点单吧。\n在太阳底下走过来，喉咙干干的。\n那个，对了，那就，冰忌廉咖啡…」%K%P
%LCClerk
%LC店员
\dTwo iced cappuccinos. Here you are.\d%K%P
「冰忌廉咖啡２杯是吧，\n请稍候」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...especially in terms of how she could still easily\npredict what I would order.%K%P
特别是连我要点的单都估计到了这一点…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「怎么了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's nothing...\d%K%P
「没什么…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIf you don't want it, I'll drink them both. I had to walk\nthrough the searing heat to reach this place.\d%K%P
「要是不需要的话我就把两个都喝了哦？\n在太阳底下走过来，喉咙干干的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'll take one.\d%K%P
「…我喝了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDon't look at me like that. I mean, I got hooked on these\nbecause of you to begin with.\d%K%P
「不要摆出那么微妙的表情嘛。\n本来就是因为受到理的影响才喜欢上这个的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDid you...?\d%K%P
「是那样的么…」%K%P
Hmm...%K%P
什么啊…%K%P
I felt an inexplicably fragile balance of comfort and\ndistress in the air.%K%P
为什么舒服和难受同时存在着，\n我连考虑的时间都没有，\n只是那不稳定的安定感，是我从没有体味过的复杂交错。%K%P
I was drinking coffee with a person I didn't think I'd\never see again.%K%P
和本以为不会再见面的人，\n竟还有着在一起喝茶的机会…\n这样的场景对我来说是不是奢望呢？%K%P
...But that was a good sign, wasn't it?%K%P
这样…轻松么？我不明白…或者说，不愿明白。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo, since you went out of your way to call a person you\nwould rather never see again, I'm assuming the purpose of\nthis meeting isn't anything personal.\d%K%P
「那么，不想再看见我的脸，\n但又特意把我叫我出来，\n你并不是要找香野麻实这个人有事吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-Something like that...\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…」%K%P
She seemed to be one step ahead of me.%K%P
又一次…\n漂亮地打了个先手。%K%P
It wasn't like I held that big of a grudge... Well,\nwhatever.%K%P
另外我，不想再看到什么的…\n不，还是算了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI have something I would like to discuss regarding\nMitoko, Ms. Kouno.\d%K%P
「关于美都子的事，想找您商量…『香野老师』」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...What's wrong?\d%K%P
「…怎么了？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt... just hit harder than I thought.\d%K%P
「稍微有点突然」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen how do you want me to talk...?\d%K%P
「我要怎么做才好啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, I'm sorry. Um, let's just chat like we used to, but\nonly focus on the topic you brought up.\d%K%P
「啊～，抱歉。\n那个，对话还是保持原来那样吧。事情就照现在的说」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat sounds complicated.\d%K%P
「真麻烦啊」%K%P
Yes, complicated. And just as difficult.%K%P
真的好麻烦。\n净是些麻烦事。%K%P
Well, I guess the two of us meeting was already a bit of\nan anomaly, so it felt almost fitting.%K%P
嘛，我们的再会本身就算不上什么正规的了，\n要说无奈，也确实是…无奈啊。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo, what's this about Mitoko? She's an exemplary student\nas far as I'm concerned. ...Although she might be a bit\ntoo zealous about lecturing and scolding others\nsometimes.\d%K%P
「那么，美都子怎么了？\n她和往常一样，上课态度认真，是模范的学生哦。\n…虽然有点喜欢训斥别人就是了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was thinking about her future. What do her prospects\nlook like?\d%K%P
「她的升学目标…\n她大概，要瞄准哪附近呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh, so she decided to continue her education, after\nall?!\d%K%P
「升学，她决定了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI decided she would. She's still... on the fence\nherself.\d%K%P
「我决定了。\n她…还没決定」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDon't you think you'll only make her angry if you get\nahead of yourself again?\d%K%P
「这…不又会惹她生气么？\n在这个阶段抢先的话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat may be true, but we have to at least decide on the\nplace she'd be aiming for. I mean, shouldn't she start\npreparing this summer?\d%K%P
「虽然可能是那样…\n但是报考的事现在必须得定下来了。\n暑假是胜负的关键吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou have a point... but what's up with you?\d%K%P
「那确实如此…不过你是怎么了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat do you mean?\d%K%P
「指的是什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI mean, you know better than anyone the reason why she's\nso hesitant about the whole thing, right?\d%K%P
「那孩子对于升学还在迷茫着，\n这事你了解得过于清楚，你是明白的吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, yeah.\d%K%P
「嗯…差不多吧」%K%P
Well, you gotta find a job first, I mean. Hmm, maybe I'll\ngive it some serious thought after seeing your first\nsalary.%K%P
『直到失业先生找到工作吧。\n对了，如果拿到第一个月的工资说不定就可以约定了』%K%P
The main... or rather, pretty much the only thing standing\nin her way was her economic situation... as well as mine.%K%P
主要…就是说，大体上的理由是…\n她，以及我，经济上的状况。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI did some research myself, and found a few places she\ncould potentially get into with a scholarship.\d%K%P
「我也试着稍微调查了一下。\n她好像是以免除了学费的优待生身份入的学」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, that's a good idea!\d%K%P
「啊，还有这一手么…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dA good idea? Does that mean you were thinking about\nhaving her take regular exams?\d%K%P
「『还有这一手』就是说…\n你，是在考虑让她参加普通的考试么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, yeah... but I like your idea. It'll also keep\nMitoko motivated.\d%K%P
「啊，是那样的…\n不过那确实是不错的方法。\n这样美都子也有理由再去努力了」%K%P
Precisely what you'd expect from a full-fledged teacher --\nher idea went slightly beyond the scope of what a mere\nguardian could come up with.%K%P
原来如此，不愧是老师。\n非父非母、只是个监护人的我是很难想到的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou seem oddly confident about this whole business. Have\nyou found a sure-fire way of convincing her or something?\d%K%P
「不过，总觉得你格外有自信啊。\n找到说服她的材料了么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu?\d%K%P
「理？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Pwh.\d%K%P
「………噗」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「？？？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhaha... Ahahaha...! I did! Indeed, I did! And this time,\nI'm pretty sure it will go just fine.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…啊哈哈哈哈…啊啊，找到了。\n我想这次就没问题了」%K%P
Yes, this time.%K%P
对，就是这次…%K%P
This time, for sure.%K%P
就是这次，一定…%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dHey, long time no see, Kaya.\d%K%P
「啊，好久不见了，小夏夜」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Hello.\d%K%P
「………您好」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWere you doing okay? I was really worried. You didn't\ncome to pick up your retirement bonus, nor did you ever\nget back to me about that new job offer. And then you even\nmoved out of your apartment all of a sudden...\d%K%P
「还精神么？我真的很担心你哦？\n不来领取退职金，再就业的事也不来商量。\n不知什么时候从公寓搬走了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI figured you had a lot going on, so I didn't want to be\na bother. As for the apartment, well... it's not like I\ncould continue paying for it without a job.\d%K%P
「我感觉伯父也挺不容易的，\n所以就不想再给您添麻烦了。\n公寓…您想，收入减少，房租也不好办了」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dI... see. This is my fault. I truly am sorry for putting\nyou through all this.\d%K%P
「是啊。\n由于我的原因让你吃了苦头，真是抱歉」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...I can't exactly admit I was chasing after a guy...\d%K%P
「……我实在没法坦白，我是为了去找一个男人……」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm having a good time. Please don't concern yourself\nwith it too much.\d%K%P
「还算舒服地生活着。请别介意」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dNo, um, you don't need to be so polite and understanding\nwith me, Kaya. We're family, you know.\d%K%P
「不，小夏夜才是，\n不用这么客气的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut you lost your company, Uncle.\d%K%P
「但是伯父，您的公司没了」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dI feel far worse about the fact that I forced you into\nliving at a run-down place like this, to tell the truth.\d%K%P
「比起那种事情，夏夜在这种破旧的公寓中\n住着更让我难过啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dRun-down...? Well, I guess it kinda is, but...\d%K%P
「破旧…嘛，倒也是这样啦」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWhen I heard you were in East Hagimori, I thought you\nwere living in a proper apartment, but this looks more\nlike an ancient boarding house.\d%K%P
「说是在东萩守，我还以为是更加普通的公寓来着，\n结果没想到竟然是这种很久之前的排房」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dA boarding house...? Well, I guess it kinda is.\d%K%P
「排房…嘛，倒也是这样啦」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dYou've got no bath, and you have to share a single\ntoilet. How old is this building, anyway?\d%K%P
「没有浴室，厕所是公用，\n而且，这房子也已经好几代了吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, I did think that part was a bit inconvenient,\nsure.\d%K%P
「嘛…我也是这么想的」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dKaya, a young and beautiful girl like you can't possibly\nlive at a terrible place like this. Look, I can help you\nfind a much better--\d%K%P
「像小夏夜这么年轻漂亮的姑娘，\n住在这么恶劣的地方可不行啊。\n你完全可以多依靠我…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI am so terribly sorry for forcing you to stay at this\nthirty-year-old boarding house with a single toilet and no\nbath. We consequently have no accompanying snacks, either,\nbut you can have your tea, at least!\d%K%P
「落成超过了３０年，厕所共用，建了个没有浴室的平房，\n真是很抱歉啊～。\n正因为这样，连糕点都没有只有茶了，请吧～」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWho is this girl?\d%K%P
「这位是？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dMy landlord.\d%K%P
「房东小姐」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm Hinosaka from the Terrace House Hinosaka. I apologize\nfor having my establishment cause so much inconvenience\nfor Ms. Kaya and yourself. ...Not like I asked any of you\nto come here.\d%K%P
「我是Terrace House阳之坂的阳坂。\n总是给夏夜小姐造成不便。\n…虽然不是我求她过来的吧」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dAh, thank you very much. You are doing a splendid job as\nan attendant. I take it you're a first year student?\d%K%P
「啊，哎呀哎呀。我开动了。\n很棒的保姆啊。辛苦了。在读一年级么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not an attendant. I'm running a business here. And\nI'm in my third year, thank you very much.\d%K%P
「不是保姆而是工作，您不用担心。\n非常抱歉不是一年级而是三年级」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHe's just trying be friendly. Could you tone it down a\nlittle, please?\d%K%P
「他的本意不是让你不高兴啊。\n原谅他吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dIn any event... I'd like to discuss your employment.\d%K%P
「啊，对了，小夏夜。\n话说回来，再就业的事情」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dListen, I said I'd look for something myself. You can\napologize to that accounting firm, so...\d%K%P
「所以说工作我自己会找的。\n已经预先通知了会计事务所…」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dNo, that's not what I'm talking about. I was hoping that\nmaybe you could return to my company.\d%K%P
「啊，不是那样的。\n我是说你要回我的公司么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat do you mean...? Didn't Houei Commerce go bankrupt?\d%K%P
「怎么回事…？\n邦永商会不是破产了么？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dYes, it did. I was talking about a new company I'm\nsetting up.\d%K%P
「啊啊，确实是。\n所以说这回是新办的公司，就是这样」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dA new company...?\d%K%P
「新公司…？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWell, to be exact, it's not going to be mine, but\nKishida's company. He was our managing director,\nremember?\d%K%P
「准确来说不是我的，而是岸田君的公司。\n你想，就是在邦永商会担任专务董事的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dMr. Kishida...? But didn't he quit last year?\d%K%P
「岸田先生…？\n但是那个人，去年不是就已经辞职了么？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dYeah, well, it was a move I made as a form of insurance.\d%K%P
「嗯，嘛，那是有先见之明啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWe actually realized that East Devices were in trouble\nback in September of last year, and after discussing the\nsituation with a few people in high places, we decided to\nhave Kishida go independent for a while.\d%K%P
「其实他了解到远东机器不妙了，在去年９月就…\n然后，上头商量了很多事情，就让岸田君独立了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dLast year...?\d%K%P
「去年…？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dI had Kishida establish a dummy... well, that's a bit\noverstating it, but he established a small company, and I\nwas actually moving our funds from us to him little by\nlittle over the past year.\d%K%P
「对岸田君来说顶替…这么说也有语病。\n建立个小公司，然后将我们的资产一点点挪过去了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dU-Um, what does that mean?\d%K%P
「呐、呐，什么意思？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShh!\d%K%P
「嘘！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dSo when I realized that East Devices was going under, I\nhad the other employees quietly move over and help that\ncompany get started.\d%K%P
「然后，因为知道了远东机器快不行了，\n就对其他的公司职员说明了情况，\n让他们参与了对面的企划」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWait... does that mean... you mean... You planned this\nwhole bankruptcy thing from the start?\d%K%P
「那么，那么，就是说…\n那个是，计划破产？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh? Eh?\d%K%P
「诶？诶？」%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
\dWhat are you talking about? I just did what I could to\nsurvive. Besides, it was all because East Devices...\d%K%P
「可不就是那么回事么。\n差额补算都已经尽量做好了。\n而且，说起来本来远东机器就…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dH-How can you plan for bankruptcy? How does that work?\d%K%P
「计、计划破产…是什么意思？」%K%P
%LCKaya
